{
  "slug": "phone-a-friend-paf",
  "name": "Phone A Friend Paf",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Phone a Friend lets Claude Code call other AI coding backends for second opinions, code review, and multi-agent collaboration. It relays your prompt and repository context to Codex, Gemini, OpenCode, or local Ollama models, then brings the response back into your Claude session. Includes streaming, structured JSON output, session continuity, multi-agent orchestration with a web dashboard, and an interactive TUI. Useful when you want a different model's perspective without leaving Claude Code.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills** and **3 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `curiosity-engine` (Structured Q&A rally between the host orchestrating model and a backend model), `phone-a-friend` (Ask Antigravity, Codex, Gemini, Claude, OpenCode, or Ollama for a second opinion through the phone-a-friend CLI while preserving…)\n- **Commands** (3): `curiosity-engine` (Structured Q&A rally between the host orchestrating model and a backend model), `phone-a-friend` (Ask Antigravity, Codex, Gemini, Claude, OpenCode, or Ollama for a second opinion through the phone-a-friend CLI while preserving…), `phone-a-team` (Iterative refinement — delegates tasks to backend(s) via agent teams, reviews, iterates up to MAX_ROUNDS rounds, synthesizes result)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install phone-a-friend-paf@claude-community` from `freibergergarcia/phone-a-friend`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 2,
    "command": 3
  },
